{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:aaa1aaefa43feb67bf3ff80996e9ed2fdf51cb16131c8840b44b7b4926101e1d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5184f452e3836bbbbcea91e14930dbb876c0770cb16a20c3f8beea05b4c51706",
      "text": "临近正式开演，热情高涨",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ce2032ba2da1e83a0fc6fb6c810379642899e85a6d9f2c5bdc6ac38e769979b",
      "text": "事务所的日程表上，练习安排排得满满当当的\n呢！大家都在做最后的冲刺啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792705d24e6e631a39bdd8263310bb9d3d1272bf69d8f9880f31d19324a22d76",
      "text": "W的两个人也发来邀请，说排练室预约很满，\n问要不要一起合练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1426e1622d2e00bb5941914238da334c49157169c4f3eaafe0b55d31b3f3dfe",
      "text": "大概是因为全员都在为了同一场演唱会而练习，\n事务所里也洋溢着热烈的气氛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b125d9aaa89a7edbf0eda38c4d6d378c79259150ba0fd982ecccdd6559bec5f",
      "text": "啊啊。毕竟也是重要的节点，很有干劲呢。\n我自己也越来越期待正式演出了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bf211385dd53b2b04aaa6e67caf4456011e11f3f24fa65093c0b66ba2710611",
      "text": "事务所怎样节点怎样的，\n根本就无关紧要吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b65fb1c8f8515fafb9cebb7e7a4029e5634e2f45db438ec11dec0bcfcfc36422",
      "text": "不管是什么演唱会，最强的都是本大爷！\n库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87a3c2b1af2cf277f6c1e835fd2645c8238a3b0b474d7f6c0814509c335c4a7c",
      "text": "哈哈！\n涟看起来也很有干劲，真靠得住啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fc21b21d01675a3b59842c5cd8aeb231b14d512f9e476728869e51feafe7c4d",
      "text": "演唱会的主题是挑战……要是比不断挑战的\n坚强意志，我们THE 虎牙道绝不会输给任何人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92c805b4e1c68f1ee267e78c3dc27a37daae3e59d8ea2c6fda27e8ba4f0339b1",
      "text": "说的也是。距离正式开演只剩一点时间了，\n可不能松懈，继续练习吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_014_22_5_06_014_22:5_06_014_22:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "啊啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
